# In a zoomed list, Enter on the title opens a new first child; Backspace twice removes its dash and then the block, and editing continues at the end of the title.
file <<END
Home:
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys j . k <Enter> <Enter>
see ▌   -
keys <BS> <BS>
status EDIT
type X
keys <Esc>
see 󰋜 › Home › GroceriesX
see     - Milk
quit
saved <<END
Home:
	- GroceriesX
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
